tter Poketchi» · № 16","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/5/52/LIATTMB20_Asleep.png/revision/latest?cb=20251025013132"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:PixSitterPoketchi.PNG","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/4/49/PixSitterPoketchi.PNG/revision/latest?cb=20210610043436","caption":"Ситтер Покетчи в «Тамаготчи Пикс»"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:SitterPoketchi4USprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/7/7e/SitterPoketchi4USprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20220719042946","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Sitter Poketchi","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:SitterPoketchi_Pix_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/f/fd/SitterPoketchi_Pix_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20250106202809","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Sitter Poketchi","sprite":true}],"related":[{"id":"tamagotchi-4u-e5ac81","title":"Tamagotchi 4U","ru":"Tamagotchi 4U","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"},{"id":"tamagotchi-4u-bcca85","title":"Tamagotchi 4U+","ru":"Tamagotchi 4U+","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"},{"id":"tamagotchi-pix-174e73","title":"Tamagotchi Pix","ru":"Tamagotchi Pix","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"},{"id":"tamagotchi-uni-52d523","title":"Tamagotchi Uni","ru":"Tamagotchi Uni","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"}]}